===== Todo 15 (Wave 3): --infer-tile-layout QA (definitive) =====
command: polykernel-opt test/infer_tile_layout.mlir --infer-shapes --infer-tile-layout | FileCheck test/infer_tile_layout.mlir

Tile heuristic: for problem dim D, tile = largest power-of-two in {128,64,32,16} <= D;
if D < 16, tile = D (SMALL-DIM CLAMP: tile_m<=M, tile_n<=N, tile_k<=K, always).
M = product(operand0 leading dims), K = last dim(operand0), N = last dim(operand1).
Attrs (discardable): polykernel.tile_m/n/k (I64Attr), polykernel.layout = "row_major" (StringAttr).

